msgid ""
"The platform connects players, teams, and organizers in a single ecosystem — "
"enabling event creation, team management, registrations, and communication. "
"It supports both public and private games and scales from small local events "
"to large multi-team operations.<br>The project was built as a modular system "
"consisting of three independent applications, ensuring flexibility, "
"performance, and long-term scalability."
